License below OR the GNU General Public License version 2 only, at your choice.
The GPL-2.0 text is the LICENSE file at the root of this repository
(https://github.com/swarm-routing/Termite/blob/main/LICENSE).

core/ includes only the C++ standard library, other core/ files and the
primitives of swarm-routing/ns3-swarm-core's core/ (also MIT OR GPL-2.0-only),
never a simulator header, so it can be used on its own: in another simulator, a
routing daemon, firmware or a closed product. The rest of the repository (the
ns-3 module in ns3/, docs) is GPL-2.0-only. See LICENSING.md.

core/ is written fresh from Roth's 2005 dissertation (ch. 4) and
docs/fidelity.md. No code from AntHocNet's GPL-2.0-only `termite` arm is in it
(AGENTS.md golden rule 13).

